      "locked": false,
      "text": "Loop is a special block of code which can repeat itself multiple times, until a particular\ncondition remain true.\n\nIn Programming there are 2 caTEGORIES of Loops:\n\n1.Entry Control Loop.  -->While, for\n2.Exit Control Loop.   --> do Whlile\n\n\nSyntax of \"While\"\n===============\n\nwhile(test_cond)\n{\n   .......\n..........\n.........\n}\n............\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Loop is a special block of code which can repeat itself multiple times, until a particular\ncondition remain true.\n\nIn Programming there are 2 caTEGORIES of Loops:\n\n1.Entry Control Loop.  -->While, for\n2.Exit Control Loop.   --> do Whlile\n\n\nSyntax of \"While\"\n===============\n\nwhile(test_cond)\n{\n   .......\n..........\n.........\n}\n............\n\n\n",
